# `fixtures` and `tests` are deliberately NOT ignored.
#
# The build stage runs the suite (`pnpm typecheck && pnpm test`) and the tests
# read from `fixtures/`, so excluding them here made every image build fail with
# `"/fixtures": not found` — the COPY had nothing to copy. `.dockerignore` has no
# per-stage syntax, so they have to stay in the context; the runtime stage keeps
# them out of the shipped image simply by never copying them.
scripts
Dockerfile
docker-compose.yml
.dockerignore
README.md
